      "title": "E.T. The Extra-Terrestrial user reviews - Metacritic",
      "snippet": "Greetings from Lithuania. \"E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial\" (1982) is a film that i do not feel any nostalgia towards, as it wasn't my childhood's film or anything. I watched it for the first time when i was in my 30's, and now rewatched it on 4K UHD in my early 40's. This movie is a pure love letter to ...",
